    "class": "gps-632369708804342421 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632369708703679125&sectionId=632369708804342421)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","label":"ggRPpiSXaPs_text","default":"<p>Christmas is about more than finding the perfect present. It is about spending time with the people you love, sharing laughter, and creating moments you will remember long after the holiday season ends. This year, make gift giving more exciting by choosing something the whole family can enjoy creating together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/ae919292-3a15-4bfb-81cf-f1086ddf7525.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_alt","default":"Christmas Family Activity Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","label":"ggR_wgsGMZ7_title","default":"Christmas Family Activity Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","label":"ggSeUar_tlt_text","default":"<p>Opening a present can be exciting, but creating something together can make the experience even more memorable. A shared activity gives families an opportunity to slow down during the busy holiday season and enjoy time together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick turns a favorite photograph into a personalized brick mosaic that can be assembled piece by piece. Instead of simply handing someone a finished gift, you can gather around the table and watch a special memory slowly come to life.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/f798d776-7ab3-4f5e-95d1-3fbe0299bf3f.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_alt","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_alt","default":"Christmas Family Activity Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI39i-YCIt_title","label":"ggI39i-YCIt_title","default":"Christmas Family Activity Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","label":"ggYZeJATo1-_text","default":"Turn Christmas Gift Giving Into a Family Activity"},{"type":"html","id":"gginLjfrm9r_text","label":"gginLjfrm9r_text","default":"<p>The holidays are filled with activities, from decorating the Christmas tree to baking cookies and watching favorite holiday movies. Building a Memobrick can become another fun activity that brings everyone together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents can build with their children, grandparents can join their grandchildren, and couples can work on a special memory together. Everyone can take part by finding pieces, placing bricks, and watching the image develop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished mosaic becomes a reminder of both the photograph it represents and the time your family spent creating it together.</p>"}],
